## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Effort | Why First |
|----------|-------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | ~2 min | False-pass risk — this test protects nothing today |
| 2 | Conditional Test Logic | ~5 min | Hidden gap — one branch is never verified |
| 3 | Sleepy Test | ~10 min | Flaky CI failures + 2 s wasted per run |
| 4 | Mystery Guest | ~5 min | Blocks running on any non-Windows agent |
| 5 | Exception Handling | ~2 min | Mechanical replacement with `Assert.ThrowsException` |
| 6 | Eager Test | ~15 min | Needs decomposition or category marker |
| 7 | Magic Number Test | ~10 min | Readability — derive expected values |
| 8 | Sensitive Equality | ~5 min | Assert on properties instead of `.ToString()` |
| 9 | General Fixture | ~1 min | Remove unused `_logger` field |

